# Service account keys. Never commit these — anyone with the file can bill
# your Google Cloud project. The broad patterns are deliberate: real key
# filenames look like <project>-<16 hex chars>.json and would slip past a
# narrower rule.
service-account-key.json
*.key.json
*-[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]*.json
**/ee-backend/
venv/

